# This repository is LF-only, and not by preference. Section 14.1 of the
# specification requires LF line endings in core documents, section 2.1 fixes
# an exact byte layout for the start of a package, and the three LICENSE-*
# files must stay byte-for-byte identical to their SPDX originals. SHA256SUMS
# hashes that LF content: a CRLF checkout would fail every text line of it,
# on Windows only, while CI on ubuntu-latest stayed green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Conformance packages and CBZ fixtures are ZIP archives. Never transform them.
*.koma binary
*.cbz  binary
